[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0010","text":"……好！要拍了哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0020","text":"……哎呀？\n要戴着猫耳朵拍吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0030","text":"啊……\n不小心按到特效那里了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0040","text":"原来是不小心按到的吗！？\n超可爱的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0050","text":"偶尔这样也不错嘛\n要不要就这样发到TWISTA上？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0060","text":"啊哈哈……嗯，也不赖嘛\n那么……来，cheese——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0070","text":"cheese……也不错，\n不过作为猫来说，鱼可能更让人开心哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0080","text":"鱼……？　嗯，那……\n────来，说“刺身——”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0090","text":"刺身——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30900500_01_0100","text":"喵——……！"}]
